OL,3,GNEWSAParents seek 'accountability'
OL,4,Aafter baby's death
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe parents of a five-month-old girl
OL,7,Fwhose death from meningitis was
OL,8,Fcontributed to by hospital staff's
OL,9,Fneglect have said they want to see
OL,10,F"real accountability".
OL,12,FEsta High died at Leeds General
OL,13,FInfirmary (LGI) in November 2023, days
OL,14,Fafter she was taken into the emergency
OL,15,Fdepartment with a high temperature and
OL,16,Fvomiting.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
