OL,3,GNEWSAParents seek 'accountability'
OL,4,Aafter baby's death
OL,5,
OL,6,FFollowing an inquest at Wakefield
OL,7,FCoroner's Court, a jury concluded Esta
OL,8,F"died of natural causes contributed to
OL,9,Fby neglect" and different care would
OL,10,Fprobably have "saved or prolonged her
OL,11,Flife".
OL,13,FHer parents, Lynsey Carr and Leon High,
OL,14,Fhave now called for changes to be made
OL,15,Fand for the General Medical Council to
OL,16,Fcarry out a full investigation.
